00:44:48.039 --> 00:44:48.960
No.

00:44:49.280 --> 00:44:50.440
What's wrong with you today?

00:44:51.199 --> 00:44:53.479
I give you money and women.

00:44:53.480 --> 00:44:54.480
And now you won't do it?

00:44:54.880 --> 00:44:55.880
No good.

00:44:56.480 --> 00:44:57.119
Wrong.

00:45:04.780 --> 00:45:07.083
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

